---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="页面未找到" noindex={true}><section class="not-found"><div class="wrap not-found-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">404 / PAGE NOT FOUND</p><h1>这个页面没有找到。</h1><p>链接可能已更新、移动或不存在。你可以从产品目录重新查找，或返回首页。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/products/">浏览产品目录 <Icon /></a><a class="button secondary" href="/">返回首页 <Icon name="arrow-right" /></a></div></div><div class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true"><span>4</span><b>0</b><span>4</span></div></div></section></Base>
